{"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with MISO","modules":[{"name":"Welcome to MISO"}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"card"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/GettingStarted"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Integrate-MISO","level":2,"text":"Integrate MISO","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","level":3,"text":"Use Swift Package Manager","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISO"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"package dependency","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to your "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode","type":"text"}]},{"text":" project by refering to it by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/pylapp\/miso-ios"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Import-the-libraries-you-need","type":"heading","text":"Import the libraries you need","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" products.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"tip","name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import MISOThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or MISOThemeableView","import MISOModules \/\/ To use modules","import MISOComponents \/\/ To use components","import MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat \/\/ To use the BlueCoat theme","import MISOTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import MISOTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import MISOTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import MISOFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"]},{"anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","level":3,"text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","type":"heading"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and useless constants.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" product which suits your needs:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Umbrella","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"MISOSwiftUI","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above and the BlueCoat theme"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISOSwiftUIBlueCoat"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above but with only BlueCoat theme"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"anchor":"Chose-your-theme","type":"heading","text":"Chose your theme","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISO"}]},{"text":" framework provides today one theme:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BlueCoat"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts without any brand-flavoured styles"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"anchor":"Apply-a-theme","level":3,"text":"Apply a theme","type":"heading"},{"columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will need to use for your application root view the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          MISOThemeableView(theme: BlueCoatTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"]}],"size":1}],"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row"},{"columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"]}]}],"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row"},{"name":"Tip","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one "},{"code":"MISOThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"style":"tip"},{"anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview","level":3,"text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use Xcode ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"type":"text","text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Apply BlueCoat theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .blueCoatPreview()","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/gettingstarted"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documenta